<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill cuts Titan Wheel.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill cuts Titan Wheel.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it cut Titan Wheel International Inc to long-term accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage said it maintained its near-term netural rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1730</p>
